   $q$What is the author's main purpose in this letter?$q$, $q$[{"text":"To persuade the trustees to allow sketching under sensible limits","is_correct":true},{"text":"To demand that the museum remove all of its rules for visitors","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overstates-claim"},{"text":"To describe the paintings the students liked best on the trip","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"off-topic"},{"text":"To complain that the guard treated the author's students rudely","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-tone"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$To persuade the trustees to allow sketching under sensible limits$q$, $q$The author suggests limits such as "pencils only" and offers to "help write a sketching policy." The letter accepts that the museum has fair concerns, so it is not demanding that every rule be removed.$q$, 'draft', 'f24dc6a5-9f39-514d-9926-0117136c9ec1')
